{"id":"n17204-1-20","stage":1,"title":"돈 · 钱","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17204-1-20-1","ko":"잘 먹었습니다. 여기 만 원이요.","zh":"吃得很饱了。这是1万韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"满足地，满意地","explanation":"잘：满足地，满意地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"5","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었습니다.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었습니다","audio":"/audio/87d7efc5604ba5a05285.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"만","meaning":"万","explanation":"만：万","readings":[{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64558","senseId":"1","lemma":"만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}},{"text":"원이요.","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；이요：用于名词性简短回答，增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원이요","audio":"/audio/5e9d7c7630d121c8fea5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"满足地，满意地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"足以感到满意地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"0fa2841136f2a818","term":"만","zh":"万","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3","entryId":"64558","definition":"一千的十倍的数目。","pronunciation":["만ː"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]}],"audio":"/audio/3768ea93459d26274054.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17204-1-20-2","ko":"어떡하죠? 거슬러 드릴 돈이 없네요.","zh":"怎么办呢？我没有零钱找给您了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떡하죠?","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떡하죠","audio":"/audio/ccce3c28cc34d68dc5a4.mp3"}},{"text":"거슬러","meaning":"找","explanation":"거스르다：找；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"거스르다","audio":"/audio/54fde6161b3b4066b107.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27340","senseId":"1","lemma":"거스르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거슬러","audio":"/audio/b649827ec36de86585a1.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴","audio":"/audio/439eeb808dc5c805626c.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"없네요.","meaning":"不足","explanation":"없다：不足；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"5","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네요","audio":"/audio/6cd7bbf5590d178ca37c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"54fde6161b3b4066","term":"거스르다","zh":"找","audio":"/audio/54fde6161b3b4066b107.mp3","entryId":"27340","definition":"去掉应该支付的钱，把剩下的钱重新给出或收下。","pronunciation":["거스르다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不足","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"钱财等不充分而穷。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/67353d549a0c4cd6357d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17204","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3643,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么办呢？我没有零钱找给您了。","你的童年是怎样的呢？","吃得很饱了。这是1万韩元。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么办呢？我没有零钱找给您了。","吃得很饱了。这是1万韩元。","你的童年是怎样的呢？"],"answer":0}]}
